"glossary" = "Verdicts: Uploaded, Attempted, Not found, Not visible. Not visible is not written as Not found. An agent that was seen but did not access or upload a file is Not found. flow_txbytes counts TCP bytes sent by that process; it is not a decrypted body. No egress verdict means the record has none of the four words. An open descriptor, or a connection seen at the same time, is not an upload. Raw secret bytes are not included.";

